# Results cache. Safe to delete; re-runs will re-fetch.
.cache/

# Vitest's own scratch space.
node_modules/

# Measurement outputs. These are point-in-time readings of a live chain and go
# stale within hours, so they are deliberately NOT committed - a stale artifact
# quoted as current is the exact failure this whole directory exists to prevent.
#
# The SCRIPTS in here are the opposite: they are the method, and a measurement
# whose method is untracked is not reproducible by anyone but the person who
# ran it. `artifacts/*` rather than `artifacts/` because git cannot re-include
# a file whose parent DIRECTORY is excluded, so the directory must stay
# listable for the negation below to take effect.
artifacts/*
!artifacts/*.mjs
# The WRITE-UPS are not data either. MEASUREMENT.md and VERDICT.md are the
# method and the decision; excluding them was a silent defect - the paragraph in
# MEASUREMENT.md claiming it "stays checked in" was false under both this rule
# and the `artifacts/` rule it replaced. A decision document nobody can clone is
# not a decision document.
!artifacts/*.md
